text:
JYP, Protect your artists! 🚨🚨🚨 

MAN FROM CHINA bought a laser pointer and GOING TO HARM FELIX (blindness) and other members. Please, take action. We demand the cancellation of the fansign in China for the safety of the members of Stray Kids. Do not take this issue lightly! 

@JYPnation

@stay_support

@Britt wait i’ll copy the text he said on Bubble!
Changbin: “the challenge i filmed with my friend, yeonjun, was after we ate meat together…he said he was sorry that he came late so he said he’d buy me meat and he walked up to pay in a cool manner but then realized he forgot his wallet hahaha
he said he was sorry and did the challenge even more diligently”
